Comment: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:43.65,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k203}拿上你的報酬滾蛋
Comment: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:45.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k226}你在這裡不受歡迎
Comment: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:49.36,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k345}這裡沒人想看到你的臉 聽到你出聲
Comment: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:51.57,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k221}你是覺得自己一直在贏
Comment: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.66,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k211}但惡魔馬上就會來見你
Comment: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:57.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k384}你知道他為什麼想要你的靈魂 對吧
Comment: 0,0:07:57.54,0:08:01.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k397}你那扭曲的欲望 把我們拖入了混亂
Comment: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:05.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k403}誤入歧途 分道揚鑣 一去不回
Comment: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:09.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k402}你點了把火 眼看它燒毀一切
Comment: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:12.93,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k337}像你常做的那樣 試圖自救吧
Comment: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:15.89,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k271}我們建起的每座橋樑
Comment: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:18.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k256}你都占為己有又付之一炬
Comment: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:20.77,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k232}只餘灰燼
Comment: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:23.77,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k300}當天地萬物消失無蹤
Comment: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:26.65,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k288}你才會想傾聆我們的聲音
Comment: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:28.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k151}低耳靜聽
Comment: 0,0:08:28.15,0:08:32.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k392}尖聲求救
Comment: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:36.12,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k318}求救
Comment: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:40.08,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k330}求救
Comment: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:44.17,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k332}求救
Comment: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:43.65,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k40}Take {\k19}what {\k28}you {\k33}got {\k23}and {\k38}leave {\k22}now
Comment: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:45.90,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k39}You're {\k40}wearing {\k37}out {\k23}your {\k87}welcome
Comment: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:49.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k39}No {\k21}one {\k24}here {\k32}wants {\k9}to {\k45}see {\k51}you{\k4}, {\k53}hear {\k67}you
Comment: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:51.57,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k64}Think {\k15}that {\k36}you {\k21}won {\k24}from {\k40}day {\k21}one
Comment: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.66,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k29}But {\k24}soon {\k19}the {\k66}devil {\k26}will {\k45}come
Comment: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:57.49,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k54}You {\k20}konw {\k30}just {\k26}why {\k23}he {\k48}wants {\k40}you{\k4}, {\k46}don't {\k83}you{\k10}?
Comment: 0,0:07:57.54,0:08:01.50,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k31}Your {\k81}crooked {\k99}desire {\k28}left {\k26}us {\k16}in {\k115}disarray
Comment: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:05.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k99}Misguided{\k5}, {\k103}divided{\k5} {\k11}at {\k13}the {\k26}point {\k29}of {\k29}no {\k83}return
Comment: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:09.55,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k18}You {\k90}started {\k12}a {\k77}fire{\k4}, {\k26}you're {\k46}gonna {\k38}watch {\k44}it {\k47}burn
Comment: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:12.93,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k49}Try {\k18}to {\k36}save {\k50}yourself {\k19}like {\k28}you {\k47}always {\k90}do
Comment: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:15.89,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k85}Every {\k44}bridge {\k29}we {\k113}build
Comment: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:18.43,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k36}You {\k28}think {\k30}it's {\k20}yours {\k21}to {\k38}burn {\k34}it {\k47}down
Comment: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:20.77,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k33}Just {\k38}burn {\k28}it {\k133}down
Comment: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:23.77,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k45}When {\k109}everything {\k40}is {\k106}gone
Comment: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:26.65,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k42}You'll {\k34}wish {\k16}you {\k45}only {\k45}heard {\k38}us {\k68}out
