Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:57.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你知道他為什麼想要你的靈魂 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.52,0:08:01.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你那扭曲的欲望 把我們拖入了混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:05.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}誤入歧途 分道揚鑣 一去不回
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:09.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你點了把火 眼看它燒毀一切
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:12.91,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}像你常做的那樣 試圖自救吧
